onsulting fees and project management expenses.  The expenses incurred under our 2021 Restructuring Plan are reported in our &#8220;Restructuring and other cost reduction initiatives&#8221; financial statement line item.  The 2021 Restructuring Plan was substantially complete at the end of 2024 and, accordingly, information for 2025 has not been provided. </span><span><ix:continuation id="F_16c60bb2-3a18-472c-8e42-d1eda27bc972_5" continuedAt="F_16c60bb2-3a18-472c-8e42-d1eda27bc972_6"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The following table summarizes the liabilities recognized related to the 2021 Restructuring Plan (in millions):</span></ix:continuation></span></p></ix:continuation></div></div>
